1
00:00:06,461 --> 00:00:07,881
Whoo! I'm all sweaty.

2
00:00:08,046 --> 00:00:10,136
Wanna log on to Second Life
and go swimming?

3
00:00:10,298 --> 00:00:12,588
(Sheldon:)I just built a virtual pool.

4
00:00:12,884 --> 00:00:16,174
(Leonard:)No. I can't look at you
or your avatar right now.

5
00:00:17,389 --> 00:00:19,099
[PENNY LAUGHS]

6
00:00:20,267 --> 00:00:22,437
Sounds like your neighbor's home.

7
00:00:23,812 --> 00:00:25,392
(Leonard:)Excuse me.

8
00:00:25,564 --> 00:00:28,944
(Sheldon:)Don't forget the mail you took
so you'd have an excuse to talk to her.

9
00:00:29,109 --> 00:00:31,439
(Leonard:)Oh, right, right, right.

10
00:00:31,611 --> 00:00:35,071
(Howard:)Stealing snail mail, very old school.
I like it.

11
00:00:35,866 --> 00:00:39,746
(Leonard(exiting to hallway):)Penny, the mailman did it again. He...
Oh, sorry.

12
00:00:39,911 --> 00:00:41,741
(Penny:)Um, no, hi, Leonard. This is Doug.

13
00:00:41,913 --> 00:00:45,083
- Doug, this is my neighbor, Leonard.
- What's up, bro?

14
00:00:46,877 --> 00:00:48,757
(Leonard:)Not much.

15
00:00:50,255 --> 00:00:51,795
Bro. Heh.

16
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:53,590
Is everything okay?

17
00:00:53,758 --> 00:00:56,048
Yeah, no. I just...
I got your mail again, here.

18
00:00:56,219 --> 00:00:58,759
Oh, thank you.
I've got to talk to that mailman.

19
00:00:58,930 --> 00:01:02,020
(Leonard:)Oh, no, that's probably
not such a good idea.

